      "text": "Repository development practice: AGENTS.md is the single source of truth for coding agents (CLAUDE.md is an @AGENTS.md shim), with pnpm-only tooling, oxlint/oxfmt via lefthook pre-commit, `pnpm verify` as the pre-PR gate, and a guard test enforcing the agent-instruction wiring and a 32 KiB AGENTS.md size limit."
