  "summary": "The product is invoked via an npx CLI (e.g. `npx vibe-replay`, `-d` for dashboard, `-p grok-bot`) that auto-discovers sessions and emits a single self-contained HTML replay file. Ask Replay exposes bounded read-only server tools such as search_sessions, get_session_summary, get_session_content, get_scene, get_session_annotations, get_session_overlays, and get_insights with time ranges like 7d/30d/90d/all.",
